{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1533,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:251eba6d9144e455d4366646",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐呐！说是集训所里\n摄影和直播都OK呢 ！\n……等会儿一起来试试吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ac85e06d15e35c41a70b0734d0c4a63fc4c3101f7f1bc7d1028affeff95ada1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f8a47745336855899ffb085",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看起来很累呢……对了！\n要不你也来做一下伸展运动吧？\n一起的话，精神也会倍增哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d652c070824da6f91eec73f9e86b59b55406a6f7aee7895bcb5159beff7eee62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "92103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0fba6d31dabf3e2f77c868b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的爱是必要的。\n为了更多地把爱扩散出去，\n助我一臂之力吧，训练员酱！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97c089a7cd81593d6aee1c7a0def69aa9cee752482320c4efd7bff9ebdab23b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "92105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3dfdc442c2577853b8bd72e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学到的东西会将结果联系起来。\n那就是用我的爱来回报你的爱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c710e9654bd12193c41b956938ddbf999e6fe63bce277426d0bbd25955c128b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "92106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a8aba0c6ba673ff9959c0d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爱与被爱。真的很幸福呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62ba5604983f2a95808959e36fcac2b33741fefbcabd844e8c6178fd2fecd7ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d97d364652f6962889401de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为大家的Love，我变强了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fb34b1c29498ed33913e7c59e206e19be684a650fee605834c19f6a6edd96a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd4429720f6d0643a1e9aa3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "增加频道订阅人数，需要你的Love哦。\n宣传就麻烦你啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "81f086ff19ae4530f08fc2ec71f4a5908ef3988f4d5839fb35358a32138b646b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "940000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:167f8846452bd055c4d0ee90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目标达成谢谢协作！\n收下这份作为礼物的爱吧♪\n之后也一起热闹向前吧♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "75fc246887adfb0dc477103bb6e2ecd19de901a667baa7b4a435739829c30489",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "940001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36c3544dd6da71f45c73d3fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，nice love！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cebf077a4dc07d115f80e36c735747b3d04444b57084ed7c00c72142b2d5786d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9559e7250a5968a55cc146b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样就更能传达爱了呢♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d3a17aea9a9eada0a0d6b5e52a3889890d3ff50269831a51d0cbdc97e1d8a4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58e6d8f1e9413b6268eef0ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Love me♡  Love you♡\n我是唯独爱你♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "47029025839e81167e0b9a6e3b1ab82071bafed4d9a4f30890eb034e75d3aeb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e0a2172db35bbfd404cbdba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们一起去填满吧！\n用无限的爱，覆盖整个世界♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "3428ac3c9ee1ffcdab65e6f241750581fab13fc0741ddc61e01933fa9a513b2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8c51c869d92eabe875b505e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要把它变成名留历史之战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b2a9580ebc048ff4c7ae27e0db9f521764d04a14076f9fc32da744bc3903333",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76e197b5776939cba10417c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "命运般的邂逅……虽然在赛跑史上\n是惯用表达……但对我来说，\n是特指与训练员的相遇呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fda06b919b3b22ae52aea3b94844de92cadab2aae95e5b192db9a48e5db6d4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5695a3d74542ff8cb0e5011a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16cc132e1dd806eedf8b6d5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf10f617dcaefa2ac3be2573",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下一场比赛观战……和往常一样……\n早上在最近车站的检票口前会合……\n这样可以吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c40ffbe8add52fec887d635cab17e67005d555ddf0a1fa1a9ab4a565656842c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dbaaba162d208717e78a9b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "人物拍摄也……再多学学吧……\n以后再一起……出远门什么的……\n应该还有这样的机会……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f18f827049df7828bcda262f2372453bffd19525a14947619a277a6cca06af89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d19101c03dd1efbfb0779947",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年参拜……祈愿的话果然还是……\n『全阵营平安』……吧！\n平安无事才能创造精彩的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3e3c03d4992d9bfe546f7e8bede1c3129eb0bc44db5b40f048babfe44288135",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20650c3283e005d4f1f2a45d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "巧克力的准备，每年都万无一失。\n多亏了『情人节锦标赛』，\n一到这个时期我就会想起来呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "02483913a4f8e2e880296405358fc75d95120529e40c6cd868925270c659a221",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:521a49283c552b2a239af014",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "试着按闸门颜色做了八种口味的\n巧克力……不知道有没有\n……能合口味的呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0682af2dd077e5d261e23080316a5133a2c89aac7588bb4e732035deebb700d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:781d68ea5fe22390432308fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看着广场上的祈福签……\n不同阵营的『梦想』在此交织……\n真好啊……真是浪漫呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7a1b2edaaff5de998459c926a0cba431f249ddb995bffe7b98d496b8ec4e06a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9928c5793677e1806fde0297",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "埋头读着史料时……不知为何\n头上多了顶丁髻假发……回过神来\n才发现被万圣节恶作剧了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e58e5a784f22ae6782adf62c76c0ad9e39125e4b3574112f67ea2a3e43f6b89f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c553d45fd167a73cb1b1e6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在我家，说到圣诞就是珍珠鸡……\n爸爸每年都会大显身手呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8753e4bd24c346454206a9981ba3cd5b1b1929b9292a6f524f09fa9d84da610c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9d0870fc1de44b59e97fa6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在的话，赛场上的灯光……\n非常漂亮……那个，今晚……\n要一起……去看看吗……?",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5831998f283786a80dc0011941a0c2b234aecfe955413b5cb8312c91996cf45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:948dff028e5c3f509ed69770",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和预想的一样…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de30aab60cab8a80dfeaace62e28edf84a29f5a37dde3adc2ed7961b968d7ccd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66d92c7706dfedd468789979",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "前不久还是二月锦标……\n现在又到有马纪念了……\n时间过得真快啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebb6ae07412974dc055c231245e1d147ec00b654d968d94ae50e22daad8ed2dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:baaaece3f64b1fc3557bb5be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐！\n训练员的历史\n又添上了新的一页呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "836791fb4bbe88c6500fc9cd1795a939da2549a7ebb2f644299393888339f66b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:277c97d2081ce8f5f0b18cde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我选了帽子作为礼物……\n毕竟，你总是愿意顶着烈日\n陪我去赛场呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "419e2913dc7ca65187d43ccb4fbf9361082e9b8a6dd4241c83d8dc8bcb476f2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6b49fd1d5fb4e2de2cdab65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黄金船发来一个叫\n『联合炒面派对邀请函』的东西……\n是要办生日会吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ae90a18bd3913b0bcb61c5b5f844a2cd21afcc8dc213ac5baa9080466d2bebb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:772a6d6edb20a7913464987b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作为生日纪念，能和我一起\n拍张照片吗？这将会成为\n我们共同写下新历史的证明……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f81c4975b483883d01c57933500350e441083618787d8db2a9a38d6fa9745199",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af750da361ae67357ea15db7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有通知呢。\n可能和赛场状况或者\n开跑时间有关……我们去看看吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "978a1702ba7d4901389d7fa5a493b176a807cd493ded88dae343681ef469535c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42717c7e50dfb24aba785526",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "礼物送到了。\n难道是URA发来的奖品……\n看来不是呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b0633c808e917c66d66c418f4170c4e78db0021012532cb8ad3514be03663dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:977b18777087ed96501b953d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务辛苦了。\n作为成就记录……\n还请收下这个。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c00386d86105df2e187af40ed52914e2bd54f2ead3c72a6a5fddb3be39db6551",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3dabbd7b5be44a37545e551",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像要举办活动。\n会上演什么样的历史戏剧呢……!",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f1ad4561b65516e9ff97491c0c1782b3bcb9f1965ba8614882bf90b9f5d3b7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a97823dde990021fce6eb7b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正在举办活动呢……\n为了记录决定性的瞬间，\n相机已经准备好了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1839d3353e1cde221f11cadd3a7829fe0a0eabc8b950573566c2979c90c0519e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a5c45098cf0abe3336c35f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真遗憾……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea388628d91740324add460da4117a9c14e91958f600421d58676a45c67854c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73505bbd40b2a02785f9abab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级好像上升了。\n呵呵，史料又增加了呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9013d68c44d0100ebab4ee7f3f3c8bf9d9d80f513ea981b44439e715a8dcf12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cba892c4a3835046f65be9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跨越了诸多历史的，\n那个京都赛场的终点板钥匙圈\n……呵呵，买到好东西了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a5c547569516994a70ecc0ca8c7603eaccb75b2347a134c973a489197bb0662",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fa0ff347f56ad90c920b023",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被赛场拉面店的老板记住了……\n最近会在点餐前就对我说\n『老样子吧！』……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cf5ea889435bdff7abdc59be616ea3cbce5da70e18e20620d2b4f00636c54c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a448f328ffdc39deb3db8c31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "头发上的缎带是爷爷送的……\n据说是舶来品……\n呵呵，我在出门时都会带着它。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d675e2cc35ecca225426e9fa3ebe3eeddeb2d029db89c6587f0a3c4ea7d46982",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4d94f761aeab0bbfe816271",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "简直就是大决战……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14b455ac7c1f433d78b7fef520d1740f01a46cb587e2360597bed033e1de3b64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7ae52890e7b5138bdaa5ebf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "精彩的对决……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba8e4d39a84986e47a6b8fa10ed8828b4418647002e2e66f36ff2c5454be72f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
